+### Private Wi-Fi addresses
+
+Phones, tablets and watches can use a **private Wi-Fi address** that changes from time to time. When it changes, FamilyFi sees a new, unassigned device, and the old one's rules no longer apply to it. FamilyFi marks these devices **Private**, and Devices and [Checkup](Checkup) both point them out.
